-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* patches/*.patch are derived from Linux kernel sources and are licensed under
  the GPL-2.0 (see the Signed-off-by / file headers inside each patch).

* payload/usr/bin/tqftpserv and payload/usr/lib/tqftpserv-bundle/* are build
  outputs of the QRTR/tqftpserv project (BSD-3-Clause), built by
  scripts/04-build-tqftpserv.sh.

* payload/lib/firmware/* are device firmware blobs. They are redistributed
  unmodified for interoperability only; all rights remain with their owners
  (Qualcomm, Xiaomi, Atheros). See the "Firmware" section in README.md.

* dts/ is derived from the Linux kernel (GPL-2.0) and from the
  postmarketOS device tree for Xiaomi Mi 9 (cepheus).
